       Identification Division.                                         00010001
       Program-ID. F115IMC0.                                            00020016
       Author.  Henning Langfeldt Rødland.                              00030001
      *################################################################*00040001
      *                                                                 00050001
      * FD Trade Finance                                                00060001
      *                                                                 00070001
      * Interface for all database access on table TF_Main_Contract.    00080016
      *                                                                 00090000
      * NB!  There are several key-fields, which may be used            00100000
      *      differently depending on the need.                         00110000
      *                                                                 00120000
      * The interface kan read one spesific occurence,                  00130000
      * or several occurences, fully or partly qualified with           00140000
      * from- and to- values.                                           00150000
      *                                                                 00160000
      * When reading several occurences, one must always start with     00170000
      * -In-Get-1st, and continue with -In-Get-Next.                    00180000
      *                                                                 00190000
      *                                                                 00200000
      * An ordinary Select call may look like this:                     00210000
      *                                                                 00220000
      *    Initialize                          R115IMC0-Main-Contract   00230016
      *    Set   R115IMC0-Version        To    True                     00240016
      *    Set   R115IMC0-In-Select      To    True                     00250016
      *                                                                 00260051
      * One of these:                                                   00270051
      * 1) Set   R115IMC0-In-Actual      To    True                     00280051
      * 2) Set   R115IMC0-In-Work        To    True                     00290051
      *                                                                 00300051
      *    Move  &fin-inst-id            To    R115IMC0-In-Fin-Inst-ID  00310016
      *    Move  &contract-type          To    R115IMC0-In-Contract-Type00320022
      *    Move  &contract-no            To    R115IMC0-In-Contract-No  00330022
      *                                                                 00340000
      *    Call  'F115IMC0'              Using R115IMC0-Main-Contract   00350016
      *                                        R7919999-Error-Area      00360026
      *    End-Call                                                     00370000
      *                                                                 00380000
      *    Evaluate True                                                00390000
      *      When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 00400026
      *        Move  '&&&&'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       00410026
      *        Perform Z900-Abend                                       00420000
      *                                                                 00430000
      *      When R7919999-Return-Error                                 00440026
      *        ...not found...                                          00450000
      *                                                                 00460000
      *      When R7919999-Return-OK                                    00470026
      *        ...found...                                              00480000
      *                                                                 00490000
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 00500000
      *                                                                 00510000
      *################################################################*00520001
