      *################################################################.11320001
       L100-Store-DCL                    Section.                       11330001
      *                                                                 11340001
      * We might already have this row in storage.                      11350041
      *                                                                 11360041
           Perform L200-Find-DCL                                        11370041
      *                                                                 11380041
           If  Ind-WS                    >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         11390041
           or  WS-DB2-Not-Read (Ind-WS)                                 11400041
             Then                                                       11410041
      *        If we have reached the end of the storage-table,         11420041
      *        we start on the beginning.                               11430041
      *        This way, we always keep the "newest" occurrences.       11440041
               Add   +1                  To    Ind-WS-Put               11450041
               If  Ind-WS-Put            >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         11460041
                   Move  +1              To    Ind-WS-Put               11470041
               End-If                                                   11480041
               Move  Ind-WS-Put          To    Ind-WS                   11490041
             Else                                                       11500041
               Move  Ind-WS              To    Ind-WS-Put               11510041
           End-If                                                       11520041
      *                                                                 11530041
      * We store the identification.                                    11540001
      *                                                                 11550001
           Move  R115IMC0-In-Table-Version                              11560052
                                         To    WS-DB2-Tbl-Version       11570052
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)11580052
           Move  FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID      To    WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-ID       11590024
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)11600001
           Move  TFMC-Contr-Type         To    WS-DB2-Contr-Type        11610032
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)11620001
           Move  TFMC-Contr-No           To    WS-DB2-Contr-No          11630032
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)11640019
      *                                                                 11650001
      * The DCL is stored if found, the status is set.                  11660001
      *                                                                 11670001
           Evaluate True                                                11680001
             When Length                 Of    DCLTF-Main-Contract      11690016
                > Length                 Of    WS-DB2-DCL               11700001
               Move  Length              Of    DCLTF-Main-Contract      11710016
                                         To    WD-Length                11720001
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    11730026
               Move  'GL-WL-DCL-UTVIDES' To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  11740026
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)11750026
               Move  WD-Length           To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)11760026
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               11770004
               Move  'L101'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       11780026
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       11790001
      *                                                                 11800001
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 11810026
               Set   WS-DB2-Not-Found (Ind-WS-Put)                      11820001
                                         To    True                     11830001
      *                                                                 11840001
             When other                                                 11850001
               Move  DCLTF-Main-Contract To    WS-DB2-DCL   (Ind-WS-Put)11860016
               Set   WS-DB2-Read (Ind-WS-Put)                           11870001
                                         To    True                     11880001
      *                                                                 11890001
           End-Evaluate                                                 11900001
      *                                                                 11910001
           .                                                            11920001
      *################################################################.11930001
       L200-Find-DCL                     Section.                       11940001
      *                                                                 11950001
           Perform Varying Ind-WS                                       11960001
                   From  +1              By    +1                       11970001
                   Until Ind-WS          >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         11980001
                   or  ( WS-DB2-Tbl-Version (Ind-WS)                    11990052
                                         =     R115IMC0-In-Table-Version12000052
                     and WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-ID (Ind-WS)                    12010052
                                         =     FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID       12020024
                     and WS-DB2-Contr-Type (Ind-WS)                     12030032
                                         =     TFMC-Contr-Type          12040032
                     and WS-DB2-Contr-No (Ind-WS)                       12050032
                                         =     TFMC-Contr-No )          12060032
           End-Perform                                                  12070001
      *                                                                 12080001
           .                                                            12090001
