                                         =     R115IMC0-In-Table-Version12170052
                     and WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-ID (Ind-WS)                    12180052
                                         =     FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID       12190024
                     and WS-DB2-Contr-Type (Ind-WS)                     12200032
                                         =     TFMC-Contr-Type          12210032
                     and WS-DB2-Contr-No (Ind-WS)                       12220032
                                         =     TFMC-Contr-No )          12230032
           End-Perform                                                  12240001
      *                                                                 12250001
